4. Experiments
4.8. Cross-Species Transfer
We evaluate whether OpticalDNA can transfer from human to rice by applying the HG38-pretrained model to RiceSubBench. As shown in Fig. 7, OpticalDNA-HG38 clearly outperforms HG38-pretrained Caduceus and JanusDNA, and remains close to rice-pretrained OpticalDNA. This crossspecies transfer result suggests that OpticalDNA's gain is not simply due to domain-matched rice pretraining, but also reflects the transferability of the OCR-style visual formulation. Detailed per-dataset results and additional RiceWGPB controls are provided in Appendix O.
